# MiniLM model weights downloaded by fastembed. The cache is created relative to
# the current working directory, so it lands wherever `av` or `cargo test` was
# run from — the repo root, or a crate directory under test. This must NOT be
# anchored with a leading slash, or only the root copy is ignored and the rest
# (87 MB each) show up as untracked files ready to be committed.
.fastembed_cache/
